items.Nakasar_Fractal_Cult_Hammer.name = Cult Hammer
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Cult_Hammer.description = The only weapon that can break the colossus' seals. Receiving it costs 10% HP. Held in hand, it corrupts: every 10 s, Corruption rises one tier (more damage taken, weakness, stun, then you drop it); put away, it falls one tier. Hitting a cultist with it, or seeing a cultist you hit die, charges it: a charged blow cracks a seal.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Seal_Stone.name = Seal stone
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Seal_Stone.description = Carved cult stone, under the neck seal.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Mist_Barrier.name = Mist barrier
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Mist_Barrier.description = Fades when the seals holding it are broken.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Landing.name = Safe platform
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Landing.description = A fall brings you back to the last safe platform you stood on.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Pressure_Plate.name = Tunnel slab
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Pressure_Plate.description = Some of them hide spikes.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Hammer_Rack.name = Cult rack
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Hammer_Rack.description = Use: take the cult hammer (only one at a time).
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Hammer_Dropped.name = Cult hammer
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Hammer_Dropped.description = Use: pick up the hammer.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Gargoyle.name = Gargoyle
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Gargoyle.description = Its breath pushes into the void. A lever at the top of the climb silences it.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Lever.name = Lever
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Lever.description = Use: shuts down a trap. Hard to pull: you are rooted for 4 s.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Cage_Door.name = Cage door
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Cage_Door.description = Use (5 times): force the door and free the prisoner.
